    <innerclass refid="structthemis_1_1observability_1_1_retrieval_provenance_record" prot="public">themis::observability::RetrievalProvenanceRecord</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacethemis">themis</innernamespace>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacethemis_1_1observability">themis::observability</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Unified provenance record for one end-to-end retrieval decision chain. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Captures the full ANN → Tensor → Graph → Final-Layer chain in a single exportable, audit-ready record. Populated by TensorRAGPipeline::step() and emitted as a structured JSON log entry alongside the per-layer layer_handoff_decision events.</para>
<sect1 id="retrieval__provenance_8h_1autotoc_md20_1s1"><sect2 id="retrieval__provenance_8h_1autotoc_md20">
<title>Fields per stage</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>trigger_stage</bold>: which gate(s) fired (FLARE / TARG / BOTH / NONE)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>tensor_stage</bold>: number of adapter candidates from tensor summary</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>graph_stage</bold>: number of graph-truth evidences assembled</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>final_stage</bold>: whether a package/adapter was resolved and which</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>chain_complete</bold>: true when retrieval triggered and all wired stages ran </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
